<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8200] Web console: unexpected confirmation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8200</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;initial state - there are no clusters&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;create a new one, do not save&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;open Advanced screen, save&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;import from DB, save&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;open Caches screen - unexpected confirmation about unsaved changes appear&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;click Cancel, save, open Caches again - unexpected confirmation again&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
